From: Laniakea Kamasylvia <kamasylvia@zohomail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 04:47:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(spike): probe-stay measurement hunk (F0' A-arm
 source)

Byte-identical F0 probe-stay hunk on the main tip: '-la_probe_stay'
keeps the editor probe alive after the rows load (AR-01 F-8 idle-probe
shape). The plain '-la_editor_probe' terminates and is unusable as an
idle probe; the churn driver settles 60s past the stay marker and
samples the IDLE editor face. HEAD + this hunk only = the A arm.
---
 App/Sources/Lightamer/UI/Shell/WorkspaceHostView.swift | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/App/Sources/Lightamer/UI/Shell/WorkspaceHostView.swift b/App/Sources/Lightamer/UI/Shell/WorkspaceHostView.swift
index f4c7c69d..a491acf7 100644
--- a/App/Sources/Lightamer/UI/Shell/WorkspaceHostView.swift
+++ b/App/Sources/Lightamer/UI/Shell/WorkspaceHostView.swift
@@ -1827,6 +1827,16 @@ struct EditorProbeIfRequested: ViewModifier {
                     note("film page final = \(inspectorState.filmPageActive) — staying alive")
                     return   // no terminate — the walkthrough drives from here
                 }
+                // F0' shell-spike measurement seam (the F0 probe-stay hunk,
+                // byte-identical): stay alive in the editor face after the
+                // rows load — the AR-01 F-8 idle-probe shape (the plain
+                // `-la_editor_probe` terminates, unusable as an idle probe;
+                // the measurement driver settles 60s past this marker and
+                // samples the IDLE face).
+                if ProcessInfo.processInfo.arguments.contains("-la_probe_stay") {
+                    note("staying alive for measurement")
+                    return   // no terminate — the driver kills its own pid
+                }
             } catch {
                 note("FAIL: \(error)")
             }
